1.1.1.1 (June 5, 2026)
- fix: Hotfix release for the BNX 1.1.1 branch.

1.2-beta.1 (June 2, 2026)
- fix: Harden security and authorization across external services and guest/import entry points to address Open LMS code review findings (OL-3.2.1, OL-3.2.2, OL-3.2.3, OL-3.2.5, OL-3.2.6, OL-3.2.7, OL-3.2.10, OL-3.1.5).
- fix: Enforce explicit capability checks in external APIs and the import flow, and deny restricted context access by throwing exceptions.
- fix: Apply stricter input cleaning for guest and external parameters, and add explicit external parameter validation in the BNX meeting info service.
- fix: Sanitize user-submitted values before storage and format meeting description through context-aware output APIs in template and recording metadata paths (OL-3.2.8, OL-3.2.9, OL-3.2.11).
- fix: Add null guards in external destination instance resolution to avoid runtime fatals on invalid import requests.
- fix: Add null guards after instance::get_from_instanceid() in addon and output paths (OL-3.1.6), and replace array_merge_recursive() with array_merge() for recording SQL bind parameters (OL-3.1.8).
- fix: Batch recording status updates to remove N+1 writes, reuse the mod_bigbluebuttonbn renderer across recording table rows, and short-circuit the BNX footer hook on non-BBB pages (OL-3.1.9).
- fix: Switch settings labels to deferred lang_string resolution (OL-3.1.10).
- chore: Rewrite the overridenav AMD module without jquery (OL-3.1.1), replace window-based pagination signaling with a CustomEvent flow (OL-3.1.7), and move the inline guest-login JS into a new bbbext_bnx/guest_login AMD module (OL-4.1.4).
- chore: Remove unused optional_param declarations and the nested dirname() chain in bbb_view.php (OL-4.1.1, OL-4.1.3), drop unused class imports in hook_callbacks and action_url_parameters (OL-4.1.2), and gate developer diagnostics in the import output behind DEBUG_DEVELOPER (OL-4.1.7).
- feat: Discover presentation providers via the sidecar contract instead of hard-coded coupling (OL-3.1.4), emit a `\bbbext_bnx\event\state_changed` event on enable/disable, and remove the legacy sidecar_state_manager that mutated parent module enablement (OL-3.1.3, OL-4.1.5).
- fix: Isolate parent-table lookups behind a documented shim (OL-3.2.4).
- fix: Memoize sidecar sort order to remove N+1 get_config() calls on every recordings-table render (OL-3.1.9).
- chore: Document the sidecar contract and integration boundaries in README and backfill the version history.
- chore: Add PHPUnit tests for the guest-login password compare, external null guards, and external parameter validation (OL-3.2.6, OL-3.1.6, OL-3.2.10), and Behat scenarios for guest-login password validation and the BNX recordings table (OL-4.1.6).
- chore: Sync the db/install.xml schema VERSION with version.php on each release (OL-3.1.2).
- chore: Consolidate db/events.php to a single config_log_created observer; the second observer was removed together with sidecar_state_manager (OL-4.1.5).
- chore: See docs/release-notes/1.2-beta.1.md for the per-commit Open LMS remediation log and validation summary.

1.1.1 (June 1, 2026)
- fix: Avoid forcing guest=true for moderator joins so moderator access is not misclassified as guest access (MD-109).
- fix: Fix missing recording row creation when BigBlueButton create calls fail in specific error paths (MDL-88775).

1.1 (May 1, 2026)
- feat: Migrate BN Reminders functionality and reminder data into BNX, consolidating reminder settings and email customization into the core BNX experience (MD-90, MD-104).
- feat: Migrate lock settings controls from bnx_locksettings into BNX and absorb the legacy sidecar configuration into BNX defaults (MD-107).
- chore: Refactor mod form header label overrides into a reusable helper to simplify BNX-driven form customizations (MD-100).
- feat: Add a shared developer debug helper for BNX sidecars.

1.0.1 (April 1, 2026)
- feat: Add a BNX-specific guest access endpoint (guest.php) with its own join form, URL builder, and logout redirect flow, replacing the core guest page in BNX contexts (GIT-1).
- fix: Hide BBB server setup instructions in the activity settings when credentials are pre-configured (MD-98).
- feat: Improve recordings table UX (MD-94).
- feat: Support auto-set default settings decoupled from sidecars (MD-95, MD-97).

1.0 (March 11, 2026)
- feat: First stable open-source release of bbbext_bnx.
- feat: Introduce the BNX Framework: BigBlueButton BN Experience is a foundational UX enhancement extension for BigBlueButton in Moodle, featuring moderator approval workflows and shared capabilities that power the BNX extension family.
- feat: Add PreSession lobby access which replaces Wait for Moderator.
- feat: Deliver an enhanced recording experience by improving the room recordings table and ensuring recording features work end-to-end.

